      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "# Getting Started with NexusCore\n## Authentication\n*   Use your API key in the `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header.\n*   Keys are retrieved from the dashboard under \"My Credentials.\"\n*   Rotate keys every 90 days for security.\n## Making Your First Request\n*   Send a GET request to `/v1/status` to verify connectivity.\n*   Example: `curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_KEY\" https://api.nexuscore.io/v1/status`\n*   Response includes a JSON object with server health metrics.\n## Error Handling\n*   Check the `error` field in the response body for failure details.\n*   Common codes: `401` (Unauthorized), `429` (Rate Limited), `500` (Server Error).\n*   Implement retry logic for transient 5xx errors.",
      "source": "target",
